<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Candle care</span>
      <h2>Get the most from every burn.</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="care-steps stagger">
      <div class="care-step">
        <div class="care-step-number">01</div>
        <h4>Trim the wick</h4>
        <p>Before each lighting, trim the wick to 1/4 inch. This prevents soot, ensures an even burn, and extends the life of your candle.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="care-step">
        <div class="care-step-number">02</div>
        <h4>First burn matters</h4>
        <p>Allow the wax pool to reach the edge on the first burn (about 2 hours for the 9 oz size). This prevents tunneling and ensures an even burn every time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="care-step">
        <div class="care-step-number">03</div>
        <h4>Snuff, don't blow</h4>
        <p>Use a candle snuffer or dip the wick into the wax and back up. This preserves the scent, prevents smoke, and keeps the wick centered for next time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-center reveal" style="margin-top:64px;max-width:640px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">
      <h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;margin-bottom:24px">Safety first</h3>
      <ul style="text-align:left;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;line-height:2">
        <li>Never leave a burning candle unattended</li>
        <li>Keep away from drafts, children, and pets</li>
        <li>Never burn for more than 4 hours at a time</li>
        <li>Stop burning when 1/2 inch of wax remains</li>
        <li>Place on a heat-resistant surface</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-center reveal" style="margin-top:64px;max-width:640px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">
      <h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;margin-bottom:24px">Diffuser care</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8">Flip the reeds every 1-2 weeks to refresh the scent. Replace reeds every 3-4 months. Keep away from direct sunlight and heat sources. Refill with our aroma oil drops when the liquid runs low.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

